---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo evaluator show])

    Identifier{Fully qualified identifier?}
    Lookup[Lookup evaluator by identity]
    Found{Evaluator exists?}
    Payload[Build detail payload]

    Success([Success response])

    IdentifierFail([Identifier format error])
    NotFoundFail([Evaluator not found error])
    LookupFail([Database lookup error])

    Start --> Identifier

    Identifier -- No --> IdentifierFail
    Identifier -- Yes --> Lookup

    Lookup --> Found
    Lookup -. Lookup fails .-> LookupFail

    Found -- Yes --> Payload
    Found -- No --> NotFoundFail

    Payload --> Success

    class Start command
    class Success success
    class Identifier,Lookup,Found,Payload system
    class IdentifierFail,NotFoundFail,LookupFail error
